    <published>2026-09-24T06:00:00Z</published>
    <updated>2026-09-24T06:00:00Z</updated>
    <author><name>AATF AI News Aggregator</name></author>
    <summary type="html"><![CDATA[<p><strong>Bot Screen launch dominates the week.</strong> The clear headline is <strong>Hermes Desktop</strong>'s <strong><a href="https://hermes-agent-news.vercel.app/?date=2026-09-24&amp;category=social#item-ef6b4179c4fa" class="internal-link" rel="noopener noreferrer">Bot Screen</a></strong> feature: <strong>@NousResearch</strong>'s official announcement (top post, highest engagement in batch) and <strong>@Teknium</strong>'s companion launch of <strong><a href="https://hermes-agent-news.vercel.app/?date=2026-09-24&amp;category=social#item-4784626f2a61" class="internal-link" rel="noopener noreferrer">live desktop passthrough</a></strong> (173k views, 1.1k+ likes) let users watch agent sessions stream in real time and take over the agent's machine interactively. Official onboarding moved fast — <strong>@NousResearch</strong> distributed <strong>@tonbistudio</strong>'s <strong><a href="https://hermes-agent-news.vercel.app/?date=2026-09-24&amp;category=social#item-d84a2bc0a85d" class="internal-link" rel="noopener noreferrer">walkthrough</a></strong> (44k views) and <strong>@Teknium</strong> amplified the <strong><a href="https://hermes-agent-news.vercel.app/?date=2026-09-24&amp;category=social#item-d03d44ef66a9" class="internal-link" rel="noopener noreferrer">guide video</a></strong> — with community reactions like <strong><a href="https://hermes-agent-news.vercel.app/?date=2026-09-24&amp;category=social#item-014ad26a44c6" class="internal-link" rel="noopener noreferrer">"Finallllly!"</a></strong> signaling a long-awaited feature. <strong>Jev × OMH ecosystem tooling:</strong> <strong>@rlaope</strong> drove the biggest builder updates, shipping <strong>oh-my-hermes (OMH)</strong> support for <strong><a href="https://hermes-agent-news.vercel.app/?date=2026-09-24&amp;category=social#item-415aecf318f8" class="internal-link" rel="noopener noreferrer">Jev-Skills</a></strong>, <strong>Model Routing</strong>, aliases and plugins, plus the open-source <strong><a href="https://hermes-agent-news.vercel.app/?date=2026-09-24&amp;category=social#item-8530d32deea5" class="internal-link" rel="noopener noreferrer">jeval</a></strong> tool for Jev evaluation and visualization (a near-duplicate jeval post was deduped out of the top list). <strong>Core-team support:</strong> <strong>@Teknium</strong> stayed hands-on — <strong><a href="https://hermes-agent-news.vercel.app/?date=2026-09-24&amp;category=social#item-d5a2f794eeec" class="internal-link" rel="noopener noreferrer">rebutting a plugin cache-bug claim</a></strong>, <strong><a href="https://hermes-agent-news.vercel.app/?date=2026-09-24&amp;category=social#item-3e1742f36c0b" class="internal-link" rel="noopener noreferrer">confirming a quick community-reported fix</a></strong>, and <strong><a href="https://hermes-agent-news.vercel.app/?date=2026-09-24&amp;category=social#item-992950038a21" class="internal-link" rel="noopener noreferrer">clarifying the new tooling is Nous-built, not Anthropic's</a></strong>. <strong>Community sentiment:</strong> practical guidance (<strong><a href="https://hermes-agent-news.vercel.app/?date=2026-09-24&amp;category=social#item-768697783517" class="internal-link" rel="noopener noreferrer">use Hermes via iMessage with any model</a></strong>) and a timely take that <strong><a href="https://hermes-agent-news.vercel.app/?date=2026-09-24&amp;category=social#item-797e0ee6c95e" class="internal-link" rel="noopener noreferrer">Claude Opus 5.5</a></strong> (GA'd the day before coverage) is "crazy" but Claude Code lags — read as quiet confidence in <strong>Hermes Agent</strong>. Low-signal chatter (emoji-only replies, link-only promos, "drop your GitHub" prompts) was excluded from the top ranking.</p>]]></summary>
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p><strong>Bot Screen launch dominates the week.</strong> The clear headline is <strong>Hermes Desktop</strong>'s <strong><a href="https://hermes-agent-news.vercel.app/?date=2026-09-24&amp;category=social#item-ef6b4179c4fa" class="internal-link" rel="noopener noreferrer">Bot Screen</a></strong> feature: <strong>@NousResearch</strong>'s official announcement (top post, highest engagement in batch) and <strong>@Teknium</strong>'s companion launch of <strong><a href="https://hermes-agent-news.vercel.app/?date=2026-09-24&amp;category=social#item-4784626f2a61" class="internal-link" rel="noopener noreferrer">live desktop passthrough</a></strong> (173k views, 1.1k+ likes) let users watch agent sessions stream in real time and take over the agent's machine interactively. Official onboarding moved fast — <strong>@NousResearch</strong> distributed <strong>@tonbistudio</strong>'s <strong><a href="https://hermes-agent-news.vercel.app/?date=2026-09-24&amp;category=social#item-d84a2bc0a85d" class="internal-link" rel="noopener noreferrer">walkthrough</a></strong> (44k views) and <strong>@Teknium</strong> amplified the <strong><a href="https://hermes-agent-news.vercel.app/?date=2026-09-24&amp;category=social#item-d03d44ef66a9" class="internal-link" rel="noopener noreferrer">guide video</a></strong> — with community reactions like <strong><a href="https://hermes-agent-news.vercel.app/?date=2026-09-24&amp;category=social#item-014ad26a44c6" class="internal-link" rel="noopener noreferrer">"Finallllly!"</a></strong> signaling a long-awaited feature. <strong>Jev × OMH ecosystem tooling:</strong> <strong>@rlaope</strong> drove the biggest builder updates, shipping <strong>oh-my-hermes (OMH)</strong> support for <strong><a href="https://hermes-agent-news.vercel.app/?date=2026-09-24&amp;category=social#item-415aecf318f8" class="internal-link" rel="noopener noreferrer">Jev-Skills</a></strong>, <strong>Model Routing</strong>, aliases and plugins, plus the ope